{"parentUuid":"84b597ef-6cae-44b6-ba66-83974509d23d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdpu3wSvsnAWKKDDu9rJw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"While that runs, recording the reversal in the decisions wiki so the direction change is durable rather than living only in this session:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_read_input_tokens":45661,"output_tokens":1491,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1491,"cache_read_input_tokens":45661,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdpu3uuunLoRJhkViFoyE","type":"assistant","uuid":"e6f57537-f6d2-4674-906b-0fd43dbf0fd3","timestamp":"2026-08-08T07:37:09.147Z","effort":"high","session_id":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini","sessionId":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"e6f57537-f6d2-4674-906b-0fd43dbf0fd3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdpu3wSvsnAWKKDDu9rJw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UmoPXjV5SvqnLCUszHqdww","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini/.omc/wiki/cybernaut-mini-scope-decisions-2026-07-28.md","old_string":"## Baseline at time of decision\n204 tests passing, `make check` green, Kedro `index_build` + `evaluation`\npipelines exist, zero blog references anywhere in `src/`, exactly one README in\nthe repo.","new_string":"## Baseline at time of decision\n204 tests passing, `make check` green, Kedro `index_build` + `evaluation`\npipelines exist, zero blog references anywhere in `src/`, exactly one README in\nthe repo.\n\n## Amendment 2026-08-08 — differentiation dropped, fidelity + scale adopted\n\nReverses the short-lived \"build a shard NOSIBLE does not carry\" direction.\n\n1. **AIS trade-flow shard parked, not deleted.** Commit `4531e4f` (`trade.py`,\n   `pipelines/trade_ingest/`, its catalog + parameters entries, `test_trade.py`;\n   548 lines) was the unpushed tip of `main`. Preserved intact on branch\n   `shard/ais-trade-flow`; `main` rewound to `e149331`. Recoverable at any time.\n   Orphaned pipeline outputs `data/01_raw/ais_snapshot.jsonl` and\n   `data/02_intermediate/ais_positions.jsonl` deliberately left on disk.\n\n2. **New goal — reproduce the NOSIBLE stack as closely as possible, at scale.**\n   Novel components are out of scope; fidelity to the blog is the objective.\n\n3. **Scale target — full corpus on a single large host.** Not a distributed\n   cloud build. Corpus and index grow to NOSIBLE-like volume while staying\n   runnable on one machine.\n\n4. **AWS is a later phase, explicitly deferred.** \"Move to AWS after we do as\n   much locally as we can.\" No cloud dependency may be introduced before that\n   phase. Note: no AWS credentials exist in the devcontainer — `~/.aws` is\n   absent, no key env vars, no `aws` CLI, and `.devcontainer/devcontainer.json`\n   binds only `~/env` and `~/.ssh`. The `AWS_PROFILE=default` seen in-container\n   is a false signal set unconditionally by `env/zshrc:139`.\n\n5. **The learning mandate is unchanged and still primary.** User reaffirmed:\n   \"I still need to understand the tech.\" Decisions 6 and 7 above (executable\n   `make docs-check`, folder READMEs with mermaid, per-stage notebooks, guided\n   `docs/` path, `explain --stage N`) apply to every component added under the\n   new fidelity goal — wider reproduction means more to document, not less."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_read_input_tokens":45661,"output_tokens":1491,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1491,"cache_read_input_tokens":45661,"cache_creation_input_tokens":147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":147},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdpu3uuunLoRJhkViFoyE","type":"assistant","uuid":"68b2def8-223f-426f-9de0-2ee7794149cb","timestamp":"2026-08-08T07:37:20.289Z","effort":"high","session_id":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini","sessionId":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"main"}
