{"parentUuid":"355d31c1-2746-4a3b-bdf6-e65b7efe69c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdpuofCrMXyK3F9F9eeh7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**AWS CLI v2 is installed in the running container** — `aws-cli/2.36.19`, exit 0, at `/usr/local/bin/aws`. That half needed no rebuild.\n\nThe credentials half does need your host terminal. Once you've run the two `docker cp` / `chown` commands, tell me and I'll verify with `aws sts get-caller-identity`.\n\n**What's a snapshot vs. what's permanent** — worth being clear, because these two paths behave differently:\n\n| | Now (copy) | After rebuild (mount) |\n|---|---|---|\n| AWS CLI | Installed ✓ | Dockerfile line, reinstalled |\n| Credentials | One-time copy | Live bind, tracks host |\n| `aws sso login` on host | Container copy goes stale | Container sees it immediately |\n| Container writes | Stay in container | Reach the host file |\n\nThe consequence that'll bite you: if you use SSO, the copied token expires (typically hours) and re-running `aws sso login` on the Mac won't refresh what's in the container — you'd re-run `docker cp`. If you use long-lived access keys, the copy just works until you rotate them.\n\nYour future-rebuilds concern is already handled — `devcontainer.json:41` carries the real mount, and `initializeCommand` guards the ownership case. Nothing further needed there.\n\nTwo loose ends unchanged from before: the three `.devcontainer/` edits are uncommitted, and the two scope questions (park `e149331` or keep it; components-first vs corpus-first) are still yours to call."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":65153,"output_tokens":517,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":517,"cache_read_input_tokens":65153,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdpuodhp5d25YpurAZudg","type":"assistant","uuid":"6b85eb8e-cf33-45b9-8b01-76e1d53b9880","timestamp":"2026-08-08T07:47:01.742Z","effort":"high","session_id":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini","sessionId":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"main"}
