g. We don't need to worry that Gene is also a name and, in some other shards, would co-occur a lot with \"Willy Wonka\".\n403:At this point we finally have (1) our instruction-optimized embeddings, (2) our expanded set of search terms, (3) our search intents, and (4) a list of 10-30 shards that almost certainly contain documents that relate directly to our question. This package of information is then broadcast to each of the final shards.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2519cec7-1b54-4c00-a536-a690a771d038","session_id":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini","sessionId":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"main"}
