{"parentUuid":"c74288e9-af13-4931-b93a-0c74c93e90cf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdq2UArZTn9XBN9kYYMHR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two API facts that matter: `from_pretrained` has **no `revision` parameter**, and `force_download` defaults to **True**. The first would break this repo's pinning discipline (`ReproducibilityHooks` aborts unpinned prod builds); the second would re-download on every construction. Both are handled below."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":199768,"output_tokens":1914,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":721,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1914,"cache_read_input_tokens":199768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":721},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdq2U7nGRNqgCxApG3qTt","type":"assistant","uuid":"54b4d6e6-e003-4d0f-968d-701b2be23038","timestamp":"2026-08-08T09:14:32.349Z","effort":"high","session_id":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini","sessionId":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"54b4d6e6-e003-4d0f-968d-701b2be23038","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdq2UArZTn9XBN9kYYMHR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DoUh2NQVr6P26BxBjJ3oyY","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini/src/cybernaut_mini/providers/embeddings.py","old_string":"\"\"\"Embedding providers behind a common protocol.\n\n``HashEmbedder`` is a first-class deterministic offline provider (feature hashing of\ntokens and character trigrams), not a test mock. ``SentenceTransformersEmbedder``\nwraps E5-style models and is the quality option; it may download weights on first use.\n\"\"\"","new_string":"\"\"\"Embedding providers behind a common protocol.\n\nThree providers, in ascending order of cost:\n\n``Model2VecEmbedder`` is the DEFAULT. Static (lookup-table) embeddings distilled\nfrom a real transformer — semantic structure without torch, so it ships in the\ncore dependencies rather than an extra. It is what shard learning needs: shards\nare k-means clusters over document vectors, and clustering only produces coherent\nshards if the vector space carries meaning.\n\n``HashEmbedder`` is a deterministic offline provider (feature hashing of tokens and\ncharacter trigrams), not a test mock. It is real, fast and needs no download, but\nfeature hashing has NO semantic structure — documents about the same topic land in\nunrelated buckets. It is therefore correct for offline/deterministic tests and\nWRONG for learning shards. It is no longer the default for exactly that reason.\n\n``SentenceTransformersEmbedder`` wraps E5-style models and is the quality ceiling;\nit needs the optional 'st' extra (torch) and downloads weights on first use.\n\nBlog reference: \"The Road to Cybernaut-1\", stage 5 (Shard Selection) — the dense\nselector compares question embeddings against shard summary embeddings, so shard\nquality is bounded above by embedding quality.\n\nAssumptions: model2vec's distilled vectors are close enough to their teacher to\ncluster comparably. Not verified here; the ablation belongs in evals.\nAlternatives rejected: keeping the hash embedder as default (cheap, but yields\nincoherent shards and would make stages 5-7 look broken when the fault is the\nembedder); making sentence-transformers the default (best vectors, but pulls torch\ninto every install and breaks a bare `kedro run`).\n\"\"\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":199768,"output_tokens":1914,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":721,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1914,"cache_read_input_tokens":199768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":721},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdq2U7nGRNqgCxApG3qTt","type":"assistant","uuid":"3c6f3fc9-0a1b-4568-8259-ac6381e37ea4","timestamp":"2026-08-08T09:14:42.864Z","effort":"high","session_id":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspaces/cybernaut_mini","sessionId":"1739850f-85bf-4d10-b02b-a0b2492e7df8","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"main"}
